@startuml F7.5-D03-salvar-revisao
title F7.5-D03 — Salvar revisão
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "CTController" as Ctrl
participant "SaveRevisionUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: Salvar
WebApp -> Jwt: POST .../{id}/revisoes
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE ARCHIVED\n+ INSERT CURRENT\n+ audit_log
note right of UC
  um CURRENT só
end note
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> WebApp: 201
WebApp --> Admin: histórico atualizado

@enduml
